Z||000002||HummelHund||08-09-2001||09:54 PM||||If I remember correctly there's a screw attached to the switch that turns on your backup lights. Remove the shifter surround and you should be able to see it, I think you can adjust the screw to whatever length you need. <P>------------------<BR>Sean W.<BR>'84 SE 2M4 WS6, The "Buzz Bomb". (restoration project to become daily driver)<BR>'84 Sport Coupe, The "Black Wedge of Death" ($150 running car)||||reg||1
